<%- include('partials/header') %>
<section class="grid gap-10 rounded-3xl bg-emerald-950 px-7 py-10 text-white shadow-xl sm:px-12 sm:py-14 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_.8fr] md:items-center">
  <div>
    <p class="mb-4 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-emerald-200">Finance concept preview</p>
    <h1 class="max-w-2xl text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">A clearer path for farms and small businesses to grow.</h1>
    <p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-base leading-7 text-emerald-50/85">HarvestBridge is an early product concept exploring a simpler way to understand financing options and application steps.</p>
    <p class="mt-5 inline-flex rounded-xl border border-amber-200/30 bg-amber-100/10 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-amber-100">This preview is not accepting applications or offering loans.</p>
    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/login" class="rounded-xl bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-950 hover:bg-emerald-50">Applicant sign in</a>
      <a href="/signup" class="rounded-xl border border-white/30 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-white/10">Create account</a>
      <a href="/admin/login" class="rounded-xl border border-amber-200/50 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-amber-100 hover:bg-amber-100/10">Admin preview</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-sm rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/10 p-6 backdrop-blur">
    <img src="/public/logo.svg" alt="" width="64" height="64" class="mb-5 h-16 w-16" />
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Built around real work</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-emerald-50/80">A future experience for farmers and small business owners, with clear steps and understandable terms.</p>
    <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-sm text-emerald-50">
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-emerald-300">01</span><span>Explore the intended application journey</span></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-emerald-300">02</span><span>Review transparent pricing before applying</span></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-emerald-300">03</span><span>Know how personal information will be protected</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mt-10 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
  <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-800">Agriculture</p>
    <h2 class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold">Season-aware planning</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">A concept for financing journeys that reflect the needs and timing of farm businesses.</p>
  </article>
  <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-800">Small business</p>
    <h2 class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold">Room to build</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">A concept for making possible funding paths easier to understand from the start.</p>
  </article>
  <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-800">Trust</p>
    <h2 class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold">Clear terms first</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Before launch, the service needs real operating details, transparent pricing, and secure data handling.</p>
  </article>
</section>

<section class="mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-amber-300 bg-amber-50 p-6 sm:p-8">
  <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-amber-950">Not open for applications</h2>
  <p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-6 text-amber-950/85">Account creation, identity verification, loan applications, and payments are disabled while this product is being prepared. Please do not submit real personal, BVN, banking, identity, or payment information.</p>
  <p class="mt-4 text-xs font-medium text-amber-900">HarvestBridge is a working name for this product preview. It does not identify a licensed lender or guarantee a loan.</p>
</section>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
